  "lane_targets": "SET, on the derived rate of 7 x 40-minute periods (4.667 h/wk) - MEASURED band (1-7 periods, from BUILD) plus the OWNER RULING of 2026-08-22 selecting seven; not a pure repo measurement, and not measured in the GROW or LAUNCH rooms at all. ALL THREE LANES TARGET THE FULL CERTIFICATE: Entry Level Certificate (14 cr) - Level 1 Certificate (14 cr, claimed from the six-unit 15) - Level 2 Certificate (15 cr). Award by W14, Extended Award by W26, Certificate by W38 on every lane, each milestone proven in the ledger rather than asserted. The co-delivery claim is WITHDRAWN on all three lanes (was E3 7 h, L1 2 h): at 4.667 h/wk the hours are real supervised time and the six-unit ledgers close without it, leaving 37.3 h (E3), 42.3 h (L1) and 57.3 h (L2) of declared QA/consolidation."
